// Weight-free compilation: the fused prefill, which serves every native
// configuration, the P512 fused decode and the decode's LM head. No device
// execution. Use make compile-all for the decode of every native configuration.
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, llvm_link_pre23
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile P=512 BUILD_DIR=%t PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: Compilation passed.
